    "provinceDeepAtlasProfile": {
      "oneLine": "Valerune is centered at -33.735193, 69.650939 under Runic Concord, with 45,575,000 people across 8 settlements.",
      "extremeAtlasDescription": "Valerune occupies 5,811,759.15 sq mi / 15,052,387.09 sq km of modeled Earth-sized territory, about 2.951067% of Belavadös's surface. It is not merely a province but a continent-scale civic machine: Partial forest, Farming and Beach and reefs with water define its broad terrain, while its settlements intensify into Partial forest, Beach and reefs with water and Beach and grass with water. Population density is 3.028 people/sq km / 7.842 people/sq mi, which lets wilderness, roads, faction-held corridors, and vast uncrowded borders remain huge.",
      "peopleFactionsAndFaith": "The strongest public people-groups are Humans, Near-Humans, and Mixed Heritage, Halfling and Smallfolk, Animalfolk and Mammalian Anthropomorphs, Elf Parent Race and Elf Bloodlines, Amphibious and Aquatic Peoples, Dwarven and Gnomish Kin, and 2 more. Frequently recorded peoples include Human, Halfling — Lightfoot Halfling, Harengon, Elf — Wood Elf, Halfling — Stout Halfling, Kender, Kithkin, Centaur, and 4 more. Faction visibility leans toward The Brass Concordat, with worship and patronage records naming Nebyrr, Ishtanora, Iskareth, Raeshkul, Sigrananna, Marduthor, Bastveig, and 3 more.",
      "groupLinkDescription": "The province participates in 10 recorded four-province geography group links, including 9 cross-transportation-group links. These links place it inside overlapping regional corridors rather than one isolated block, allowing border-adjacent transit, faction influence, and cultural spillover to breathe across group lines.",
